──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── VECTOR ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
The services that need a restart after the main database fails over are ledger-service, payments-api, orders-api, and 
notification-service. The order in which they must be restarted is as follows: 
1. ledger-service 
2. payments-api (in rolling batches) 
3. orders-api 
4. notification-service 

This sequence is critical to avoid issues with stale connections and dependencies between services [1][2][3][7].
